# 基准路线：保存并退出、再进同一个角色（存盘、拆局、前端、读取、建局）。mark 切段：leave（保存并退出到前端）、join（进局到读取画面撤下）
# Benchmark route: Save and Exit, then rejoin the same character (save, teardown, front end, loading, game creation). Segments cut by mark: leave (Save and Exit to the front end), join (entering until the loading screen goes away)
name rejoin
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
timeout 240

enter_game
sleep 2
mark leave
open_pause
press A
expect game_leave timeout=30
expect main_menu timeout=60
mark join
enter_game
mark end
sleep 1
quit
check no_red
check saved
